  "worked_solution": "We know that $u\u22a5v$ ($u$ and $v$ are perpendicular) if and only if $u\\cdot v=0.$\n\nComputing the dot product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{x}\\cdot {v}_{x}+{u}_{y}\\cdot {v}_{y}+{u}_{z}\\cdot {v}_{z} \\\\  & =a\\cdot a+2\\cdot (-4)+4\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & ={a}^{2}-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & =0 \\\\ {a}^{2}-16 & =0 \\\\ {a}^{2} & =16 \\\\ a & =\\pm 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe disregard the positive solution since we are told that $a<0.$ Therefore, $a=-4.$",
